      "formats": ["csv", "xlsx", "pdf"],
      "notes": [
        "Commission is a percentage (basis points) only; there is no flat commission amount in the schema. Amounts are the ledger's commission entries at the rate effective on the entry date (hospital commission history), for online (platform-collected) bookings; desk bookings carry no commission.",
        "Total Bookings / Total Revenue = online bookings and patient payments in the ledger in the range.",
        "Commission % = the rate in effect; when it changed inside the range, the base-weighted average rate (client to confirm).",
        "Platform date filters on timestamps are Asia/Kolkata calendar days; row dates are shown in each hospital's own timezone."
      ]
    },
